"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"过婺示施耕县丞","author":"赵抃","text":"子诗赠我离杭日，劝使东来作主人。\n再得湖山老休去，而今始是自由身。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":37953,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"登云黄山","author":"赵抃","text":"云黄绝顶冠峰峦，七佛当时行道坛。\n天敛积阴千里霁，故令登赏得盘桓。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":37954,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"题婺州永康县延真观松石","author":"赵抃","text":"岁寒姿性禀于天，一变人疑换骨仙。\n操是寒松心是石，始终全类古真贤。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":37955,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"登越州新昌石佛阁","author":"赵抃","text":"南明石像世称奇，人说嘉州具体微。\n大小何烦较吴蜀，法身无处不同归。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":37956,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"过天姥岭示男㞦","author":"赵抃","text":"吾子沿江千里来，我车不惮陟崔嵬。\n永嘉贰政年方壮，未用斑衣学老莱。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":37957,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"初入天台示男㞦","author":"赵抃","text":"景入天台日日新，安车千里去寻真。\n路逢白发老翁问，父子同游有几人。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":37958,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"题三井瀑巾","author":"赵抃","text":"三井馀波势靡停，平铺千丈落峥嵘。\n秋阳五彩随流照，纵有良工画不成。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":37959,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"双阙山","author":"赵抃","text":"峰峦如蜀剑关分，万仞千门不可亲。\n惟有诸仙功行满，云屏从此去朝真。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":37960,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"琼台","author":"赵抃","text":"台岭周回八百里，琼台中立许谁登。\n宵分疑有群仙集，月白风清最上层。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":37961,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"龙潭","author":"赵抃","text":"黯黯龙潭不测深，临观崖下已千寻。\n若逢岁旱休閒卧，好与斯民去作霖。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":37962,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"放螺溪","author":"赵抃","text":"子舆辍肉为闻声，德洽民心苦好生。\n智者教行尤可尚，放螺从此得溪名。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":37963,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"与男㞦游天台石桥览先祖诗因成","author":"赵抃","text":"石桥吾祖昔留诗，句有天寒树著衣。\n山下老僧能叹咏，诸孙三岁与光辉。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":37964,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"锡杖泉","author":"赵抃","text":"丛林枯槁井难穿，珍重禅师道力坚。\n