23e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"步虚宫","author":"赵抃","text":"妙峰高处即仙居，多为朝真作步虚。\n却是清风明月夜，一声倾听属樵渔。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":37984,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"鼎湖峰","author":"赵抃","text":"不见青莲花落时，鼎湖惟有白云归。\n一峰孤立如天柱，若较灵岩具体微。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":37985,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"仙水洞","author":"赵抃","text":"路入云端步步轻，洞中滑溜一泓清。\n不逢真侣仙踪在，犹喜磨崖纪姓名。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":37986,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"隐真洞","author":"赵抃","text":"仙洞长年卧白云，灵丹成就养天真。\n汉庭轻为东宫出，应笑商山四老人。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":37987,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"忘归洞","author":"赵抃","text":"洞天日月最迟迟，来见仙真即忘归。\n看取桃源刘阮去，旧乡虽是故人非。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":37988,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"自温江宿僧净偲秀野轩","author":"赵抃","text":"千里寻山忆烂柯，七旬归去此重过。\n因观秀野轩前景，与我高斋不较多。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":37989,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"男㞦随侍还乡欲回温赠行","author":"赵抃","text":"七旬寻胜远尘纷，身计优游荷国恩。\n往复汝勤人尽说，从来忠孝出吾门。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":37990,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"越州讲僧智月见访","author":"赵抃","text":"不惮风霜道阻修，一瓶一钵少迟留。\n稽山未可轻归去，浮石精蓝况旧游。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":37991,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"次程师孟正议题神照大师养志堂","author":"赵抃","text":"报恩堂庑缮完新，养志熙熙镇似春。\n佛子事馀为孝子，黄金园有白头亲。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":37992,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"送衢守王照大夫","author":"赵抃","text":"车骑衢民不可攀，机山云约首春还。\n綵衣堂上成童戏，八十慈亲为解颜。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":37993,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"酬前人见别","author":"赵抃","text":"退休林下屈朱轮，逸老亭边袂欲分。\n一诵高斋回首句，感公认我独慇勤。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":37994,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"送余宗道主簿赴官","author":"赵抃","text":"枳鸾新命去逢春，士论许为忠孝人。\n白首慈亲七十八，安居荣侍入西秦。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":37995,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"次韵吴天常中散","author":"赵抃","text":"教言今觉昔诸尘，不了心源未是真。\n却念樵夫无所得，当年虚作烂柯人。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":37996,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"送蔡门长官赴任丹徒","author":"赵抃","text":"柳深莺老暮春天，恭侍慈亲解画船。\n举首丹徒民万户，共迎和气作丰年。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":37997,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"十八男㞦太仆寺丞生日","author":"赵抃","text":"宠数亲承咫尺颜，清修虔命似居山。\n欲知不老个中事，应向如今悟八还。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":37998,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"送海印长老赴峨眉都僧正二首 其一","author":"赵抃","text":"归根落叶舞秋风，入蜀分携瀫水东。\n欲别何烦示圆相，普贤今作主人翁。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":37999,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"送海印长老赴峨眉都僧正二首 其二","author":"赵抃","text":"片云无著又西还，过尽秦山上蜀山。\n我独为师欢喜处，一程程入旧乡关。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":38000,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}}]